    "show_share": true,
    "description": "Dr Nancy Booker, Director of Academic Affairs at the Aga Khan University Graduate School of Media and Communications has been appointed as a member of the Media Council of Kenya's Complaints Commission for a period of three years. The appointment was made via a Gazette Notice dated October 14, 2020 by the Cabinet Secretary, Ministry of ICT, Innovation and Youth Affairs Mr Joe Mucheru.",
